-FVG trigger<select id="cgMode"><option value="count">C3 member count</option><option value="tap">Gap retest + reclaim</option><option value="reversal">First close outside C2 (fade)</option><option value="ob">OB wick break alone</option></select></label><label>Origin OB volume<select id="cgVol"><option value="any">Any</option><option>higher</option><option>lower</option><option>equal</option></select></label><button onclick="test()">Run backtest</button><button onclick="download()">Export trades</button></div><p id="stats" class="stats">No test run.</p><small>Next-open entries. Both stop and target touched in one candle: stop-first assumption. Closed-trade drawdown excludes intratrade drawdown. Results are in points, not dollars. An open final position is reported, not silently closed.</small></section>
